wikitext:
Stardew Valley Expanded adds more than 200 new pieces of decorative and functional furniture to the game. About half of the new furniture can be obtained via the [[Furniture Catalogue 2]] added in version 1.15; the remaining items are purchased from various vendors.

Most furniture can be placed indoors or outdoors, but items that are hung on walls can only be placed indoors.

{{Info|For clarity on vanilla game mechanics, see [[Stardew:Furniture|Stardew Valley wiki - Furniture]].}}

